{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24103","headline":"自宾客迁太子少傅分司 · 白居易","name":"自宾客迁太子少傅分司","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"头上渐无发，耳间新有毫。\n形容逐日老，官秩随年高。\n优饶又加俸，闲稳仍分曹。\n饮食免藜藿，居处非蓬蒿。\n何言家尚贫，银榼提绿醪。\n勿谓身未贵，金章照紫袍。\n诚合知止足，岂宜更贪饕。\n默默心自问，於国有何劳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24103.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24103","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}